stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Pending (10)" as Pending
  state "Executing (20)" as Executing
  state "Migrated (100)" as Migrated
  state "Failed (30)" as Failed
  state "NotMigrated (50)" as NotMigrated
  [*] --> Pending : file discovered
  Pending --> Executing : first block starts
  Executing --> Migrated : all blocks committed
  Executing --> Failed : a block fails
  Failed --> Executing : next migrate-up retries
  Migrated --> NotMigrated : migrate-down or rollback action
  NotMigrated --> Executing : next migrate-up
